      "text": "Decompiled and got the Wake Island map working now, which is more fun because it has planes!\n\nI just can't figure out the controls yet to fly it 😬\n\nWill add this to the main server rotation soon once I tested it enough but you can play it here in multiplayer already:\n\nhttps://bf1942.pieter.com/wake?name=levelsio",
